Age Distribution of Arestess
I am also interested in examining the age distribution of arrestees under the two administrations, particularly among younger individuals. I will focus on arrestees born in 2000 or later (age 25 or younger in 2025).

arrests |&gt; 
    filter(birth_year&gt;=2000) |&gt; 
    mutate(relative_age = 2025 - birth_year) |&gt; 
    rename(Administration = administration) |&gt;
    group_by(Administration) |&gt; 
    summarise(`Median Age` = median(relative_age)) |&gt; 
    knitr::kable()





